Agent Company: feature film
Made in code with the Lemo-Opuscar library (Living Screencast).
Screens: Agent Company 0.2, the real pages (Guild mode, the dispatch-line and trust-credits anatomy figures), driven frame by frame.
Voice: Kokoro TTS (kokoro-onnx), voice bf_emma.
Music and sound: synthesized from the film's events (no samples).
Fonts: Inter, JetBrains Mono, Cinzel, Alegreya Sans, Bungee, Press Start 2P, Orbitron, IBM Plex Mono (SIL Open Font License).
All characters, worlds and the Warden mascot are original.
